# The kite base: the sides AB and AD folded onto the diagonal AC.
origami kite
sheet square
valley AB to AC    # the bisector at A, 22.5 degrees above AB; AB's side moves
valley AD to AC    # the bisector on the other side of the diagonal; AD's side moves
expect ok
expect faces 3
expect ply 2       # the two flaps meet along the diagonal and do not overlap
